From 0000000000000000000000000000000000000000 Mon Sep 17 00:00:00 2001
From: Ivo Nunes <ivo@nunes.uk>
Date: Mon, 16 Nov 2026 14:04:55 +0000
Subject: [PATCH] gdbus-codegen: Don't use distutils.

Wheelio: distutils is gone from Python 3.12, which Homebrew's meson runs
on, and GLib 2.78's gdbus-codegen only used it to order version numbers.

Origin: Wheelio, after GLib's own later removal of distutils.
---
 gio/gdbus-2.0/codegen/utils.py | 3 +--
 1 file changed, 1 insertion(+), 2 deletions(-)

diff --git a/gio/gdbus-2.0/codegen/utils.py b/gio/gdbus-2.0/codegen/utils.py
index 0204610..4087ee2 100644
--- a/gio/gdbus-2.0/codegen/utils.py
+++ b/gio/gdbus-2.0/codegen/utils.py
@@ -19,7 +19,6 @@
 #
 # Author: David Zeuthen <davidz@redhat.com>
 
-import distutils.version
 import os
 import sys
 
@@ -166,4 +165,4 @@ def version_cmp_key(key):
         v = str(key[0])
     else:
         v = "0"
-    return (distutils.version.LooseVersion(v), key[1])
+    return (tuple(int(p) if p.isdigit() else 0 for p in v.split(".")), key[1])
